{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 06 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">可提示分割：把固定类别头改造成交互式纠错接口</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Promptable Segmentation</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_033_medsam-title\">MedSAM</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">在 SAM 提示式架构上以大规模多模态医学分割监督做领域适配，并将 box prompt 作为稳定的目标定位接口。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Adapts the promptable SAM architecture across 1.57 million medical image–mask pairs spanning 10 imaging modalities using bounding-box prompts.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">标准化二维医学图像与目标边界框</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Normalized 2D medical image slice + target anatomical/lesion bounding box prompt</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">边界框条件下的医学目标分割 mask</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Box-conditioned binary segmentation mask for the target medical structure</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2(b) · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-024-44824-z\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_033_medsam')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_033_medsam')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"MedSAM original paper architecture figure, Figure 2(b)\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/2e72090cb6c489c7ba32.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2(b) · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_033_medsam', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_033_medsam\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_033_medsam')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_033_medsam', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_033_medsam\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">医学图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">CT、MR、X-ray、超声、内镜和病理等二维图像统一强度与尺寸接口。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests normalized 2d medical image slice + target anatomical/lesion bounding box prompt and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"CT、MR、X-ray、超声、内镜和病理等二维图像统一强度与尺寸接口。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests normalized 2d medical image slice + target anatomical/lesion bounding box prompt and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"医学图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 01\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_033_medsam', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">医学图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">CT、MR、X-ray、超声、内镜和病理等二维图像统一强度与尺寸接口。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests normalized 2d medical image slice + target anatomical/lesion bounding box prompt and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"以 SAM ViT 为初始化，从大规模医学图像-mask 对学习医学视觉特征。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Image Encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"领域适配 Image Encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"Image Encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_033_medsam', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">领域适配 Image Encoder</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Image Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">以 SAM ViT 为初始化，从大规模医学图像-mask 对学习医学视觉特征。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Image Encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"真值 mask 外接框在训练时可加入扰动，模拟用户或检测器提供的近似框。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Box Prompt within the core box prompted medical sam adaptation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Box Prompt\" data-node-name-en=\"Box Prompt\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_033_medsam', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Box Prompt</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">真值 mask 外接框在训练时可加入扰动，模拟用户或检测器提供的近似框。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Box Prompt within the core box prompted medical sam adaptation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"框的两个角点经位置编码和类型 embedding 形成 sparse prompt tokens。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs SAM Prompt Encoder within the core box prompted medical sam adaptation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"SAM Prompt Encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"SAM Prompt Encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_033_medsam', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>SAM Prompt Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">框的两个角点经位置编码和类型 embedding 形成 sparse prompt tokens。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs SAM Prompt Encoder within the core box prompted medical sam adaptation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"SAM two-way Transformer 融合医学 image embedding 与 box tokens。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Mask Decoder within the core box prompted medical sam adaptation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Mask Decoder\" data-node-name-en=\"Mask Decoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_033_medsam', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Mask Decoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">SAM two-way Transformer 融合医学 image embedding 与 box tokens。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Mask Decoder within the core box prompted medical sam adaptation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"mask token 生成动态权重，并与上采样图像特征组合成 logits。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs dynamic Mask Head within the core box prompted medical sam adaptation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"动态 Mask Head\" data-node-name-en=\"dynamic Mask Head\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_033_medsam', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">动态 Mask Head</span><span class=\"lang-en\">dynamic Mask Head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">mask token 生成动态权重，并与上采样图像特征组合成 logits。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs dynamic Mask Head within the core box prompted medical sam adaptation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"跨模态、跨器官的像素级标注驱动领域适配，不改变提示式接口。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Mask to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"医学 Mask 监督\" data-node-name-en=\"Mask\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_033_medsam', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">医学 Mask 监督</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Mask</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">跨模态、跨器官的像素级标注驱动领域适配，不改变提示式接口。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Mask to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"输出框内外一致的单目标分割，可由人工框或检测器框触发。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces box-conditioned binary segmentation mask for the target medical structure via objective Mask.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"目标 Mask\" data-node-name-en=\"objective Mask\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_033_medsam', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">目标 Mask</span><span class=\"lang-en\">objective Mask</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">输出框内外一致的单目标分割，可由人工框或检测器框触发。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces box-conditioned binary segmentation mask for the target medical structure via objective Mask.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"MedSAM Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 以框提示和医学 mask 联合适配 SAM</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Domain-Adapted Medical Box-Prompted Mask Decoding (Dice + Cross-Entropy)</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"MedSAM：核心公式 · 以框提示和医学 mask 联合适配 SAM\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"33\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"21.310522pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.593865 -69.011212 339.902342 21.310522\" width=\"339.902342pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><use id=\"m033_g10-76\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m033_g7-76\"></use><use id=\"m033_g10-184\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m033_g7-184\"></use><use id=\"m033_g10-185\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:hre