xlink:href=\"#m033_g16-25\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"178.801633\" xlink:href=\"#m033_g13-92\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"184.077894\" xlink:href=\"#m033_g10-185\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"188.072908\" xlink:href=\"#m033_g16-26\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"195.199684\" xlink:href=\"#m033_g13-92\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"200.475945\" xlink:href=\"#m033_g10-185\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"204.192006\" xlink:href=\"#m033_g16-71\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"209.059755\" xlink:href=\"#m033_g13-61\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"213.75424\" xlink:href=\"#m033_g10-186\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"217.569916\" xlink:href=\"#m033_g16-150\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"222.119469\" xlink:href=\"#m033_g16-37\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"228.963787\" xlink:href=\"#m033_g10-185\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"232.918952\" xlink:href=\"#m033_g16-49\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"238.414345\" xlink:href=\"#m033_g13-61\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"243.108831\" xlink:href=\"#m033_g10-186\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"246.924507\" xlink:href=\"#m033_g10-186\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"250.740182\" xlink:href=\"#m033_g16-150\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"255.399322\" xlink:href=\"#m033_g16-72\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"260.366699\" xlink:href=\"#m033_g13-61\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"265.061185\" xlink:href=\"#m033_g10-186\" y=\"-58.831901\"></use><use x=\"268.876749\" xlink:href=\"#m033_g10-188\" y=\"-58.831901\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">原 SAM 跨到医学低对比、多模态图像时 zero-shot 波动大</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Out-of-the-box natural-image SAM exhibited high variance and boundary leakage on low-contrast, multi-modality medical scans.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">在 157 万医学 image-mask pairs 上领域微调 SAM</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Fine-tune SAM's image encoder and mask decoder on a massive multi-modality medical corpus using bounding boxes as a reliable spatial prompt.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">覆盖 10 种模态的大规模 box-prompt 训练和内外部任务评估</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Curated 1.57M medical image–mask dataset across 10 modalities + end-to-end domain adaptation with extensive internal/external validation.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用于跨模态交互式医学分割与标注加速</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Standard interactive box-prompted segmentation tool for radiology, oncology, endoscopy, and pathology annotation.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">强领域适配证据；仍依赖 box prompt，非全自动 3D 终点</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Strong domain-adaptation evidence; remains reliant on manual or detector-generated bounding boxes per slice/ROI.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">保留 SAM 的图像–提示–mask 三段式接口，但用医学图像-mask 对纠正自然图像域偏移。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">以 box 作为主要提示把任务限定在候选解剖/病灶区域，减少开放式分割歧义。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">训练时扰动框使模型容忍人工或上游检测器边界不精确，而不是只适配真值紧框。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Fine-tune SAM's image encoder and mask decoder on a massive multi-modality medical corpus using bounding boxes as a reliable spatial prompt.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Curated 1.57M medical image–mask dataset across 10 modalities + end-to-end domain adaptation with extensive internal/external validation.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Domain-Adapted Medical Box-Prompted Mask Decoding (Dice + Cross-Entropy).</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">框提示适合临床交互或检测后精分，但性能上限与失败模式同时依赖框质量。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">二维切片泛化不能自动保证三维连续性；体积测量前需加跨切片一致性和目标级质控。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Standard interactive box-prompted segmentation tool for radiology, oncology, endoscopy, and pathology annotation.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Strong domain-adaptation evidence; remains reliant on manual or detector-generated bounding boxes per slice/ROI.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-024-44824-z\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Segment Anything in Medical Images</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/bowang-lab/MedSAM\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
